  "title": "THE RED BRICKS OF BUKIT NANAS: A JOURNEY THROUGH KUALA LUMPUR'S CATHOLIC HERITAGE",
  "content": "\u003cp\u003e\u003cspan style=\"text-align: justify; white-space: pre-wrap;\"\u003e\u003cspan style=\"font-family: inherit; font-size: medium;\"\u003eThe humid air of Bukit Nanas carries a certain weight, a blend of damp forest earth and the scent of old stone.&nbsp;\u003c/span\u003e\u003c/span\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\u003cspan id=\"docs-internal-guid-d918656b-7fff-9dc0-7eaf-856942127c80\"\u003e\u003cspan style=\"font-family: inherit;\"\u003e\u003cp dir=\"ltr\" style=\"font-size: large; line-height: 1.8; margin-bottom: 12pt; margin-top: 12pt; text-align: justify;\"\u003e\u003cspan style=\"font-variant: normal; vertical-align: baseline; white-space: pre-wrap;\"\u003eTucked away from the glass-and-steel glare of modern Kuala Lumpur, a row of weathered red bricks stands as a silent witness to a century of footsteps.\u003c/span\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp dir=\"ltr\" style=\"font-size: large; line-height: 1.8; margin-bottom: 12pt; margin-top: 12pt; text-align: justify;\"\u003e\u003cspan style=\"font-variant: normal; vertical-align: baseline; white-space: pre-wrap;\"\u003eThis is not just a street but also a corridor of memory where the echoes of school bells and choir hymns still linger in the heat.\u003c/span\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp dir=\"ltr\" style=\"font-size: large; line-height: 1.8; margin-bottom: 12pt; margin-top: 12pt; text-align: justify;\"\u003e\u003cspan style=\"font-variant: normal; vertical-align: baseline; white-space: pre-wrap;\"\u003e\u003cbr /\u003e\u003c/span\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp dir=\"ltr\" style=\"line-height: 1.8; margin-bottom: 12pt; margin-top: 12pt; text-align: justify;\"\u003e\u003cspan style=\"font-variant: normal; vertical-align: baseline; white-space: pre-wrap;\"\u003e\u003c/span\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\u003cdiv class=\"separator\" style=\"clear: both; font-size: large; text-align: center;\"\u003e\u003ca href=\"https://blogger.googleusercontent.com/img/a/AVvXsEjPNoJeNaAuty04Uo2I_m62dVZByFwM39qhV_2Pv9dJDEiWJMRKm-o5FZi7M2yv59j-UDlN6tRwYeoIlL8RUBr_DhgI3T89qXeZHOJzJzrvam0mE1BxV0vAHxIq8yp_4bgTkyEg7K4MRX97MPWxDq5wVHI0LErjrKBkk8akpqMsQ17mi9bwi08A6GYD4oAC\" style=\"margin-left: 1em; margin-right: 1em;\"\u003e\u003cimg alt=\"KL The Guide, KLTG, Kuala Lumpur, Malaysia, Visit Kuala Lumpur, Explore Kuala Lumpur, Things to do in Kuala Lumpur, Kuala Lumpur travel guide, Malaysia travel guide, Kuala Lumpur attractions, Kuala Lumpur tourism, Travel Malaysia, Discover Kuala Lumpur, Kuala Lumpur city guide, Kuala Lumpur experiences\" data-original-height=\"967\" data-original-width=\"842\" height=\"640\" src=\"https://blogger.googleusercontent.com/img/a/AVvXsEjPNoJeNaAuty04Uo2I_m62dVZByFwM39qhV_2Pv9dJDEiWJMRKm-o5FZi7M2yv59j-UDlN6tRwYeoIlL8RUBr_DhgI3T89qXeZHOJzJzrvam0mE1BxV0vAHxIq8yp_4bgTkyEg7K4MRX97MPWxDq5wVHI0LErjrKBkk8akpqMsQ17mi9bwi08A6GYD4oAC=w557-h640\" title=\"KL The Guide\" width=\"557\" /\u003e\u003c/a\u003e\u003c/div\u003e\u003cdiv class=\"separator\" style=\"clear: both; text-align: center;\"\u003e\u003cspan style=\"font-size: xx-small;\"\u003ePhoto credit: \u003ca href=\"https://kltheguide.com.my/\"\u003eKL The Guide\u003c/a\u003e\u003c/span\u003e\u003c/div\u003e\u003cdiv class=\"separator\" style=\"clear: both; text-align: center;\"\u003e\u003cbr /\u003e\u003c/div\u003e\u003c/span\u003e\u003c/span\u003e\u003cp\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\u003cdiv\u003e\u003cspan style=\"font-family: inherit;\"\u003e\u003cspan style=\"font-variant: normal; vertical-align: baseline; white-space: pre-wrap;\"\u003e\u003cspan id=\"docs-internal-guid-19a2662e-7fff-dd83-477e-d5fdf74b652d\"\u003e\u003ch3 dir=\"ltr\" style=\"font-size: large; line-height: 1.8; margin-bottom: 4pt; margin-top: 14pt; text-align: justify;\"\u003e\u003cspan style=\"font-variant: normal; vertical-align: baseline;\"\u003eSt. John’s Institution\u003c/span\u003e\u003c/h3\u003e\u003cp dir=\"ltr\" style=\"font-size: large; line-height: 1.8; margin-bottom: 12pt; margin-top: 12pt; text-align: justify;\"\u003e\u003cspan style=\"font-variant: normal; vertical-align: baseline;\"\u003eThe journey begins where the red-and-white arches of \u003c/span\u003e\u003cspan style=\"font-variant: normal; font-weight: 700; vertical-align: baseline;\"\u003eSt. John’s Institution\u003c/span\u003e\u003cspan style=\"font-variant: normal; vertical-align: baseline;\"\u003e curve along the hillside. Built in 1904, the building feels less like a school and more like a fortress of knowledge.&nbsp;\u003c/span\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp dir=\"ltr\" style=\"font-size: large; line-height: 1.8; margin-bottom: 12pt; margin-top: 12pt; text-align: justify;\"\u003e\u003cspan style=\"font-variant: normal; vertical-align: baseline;\"\u003eSunlight filters through the corridors, catching the dust motes that dance where generations of \"Johannians\" once sprinted to class.\u003c/span\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp dir=\"ltr\" style=\"font-size: large; line-height: 1.8; margin-bottom: 12pt; margin-top: 12pt; text-align: justify;\"\u003e\u003cspan style=\"font-variant: normal; vertical-align: baseline;\"\u003eWhile historically a bastion for boys, there is a subtle shift in the rhythm here.&nbsp;\u003c/span\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp dir=\"ltr\" style=\"font-size: large; line-height: 1.8; margin-bottom: 12pt; margin-top: 12pt; text-align: justify;\"\u003e\u003cspan style=\"font-variant: normal; vertical-align: baseline;\"\u003eIn the higher forms, the sea of white and green uniforms welcomes girls into the fold, blending the school’s rigid tradition with a more inclusive present.\u003c/span\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp dir=\"ltr\" style=\"font-size: large; line-height: 1.8; margin-bottom: 12pt; margin-top: 12pt; text-align: justify;\"\u003e\u003cspan style=\"font-variant: normal; vertical-align: baseline;\"\u003eIt is a place of sharp collars and even sharper heritage.\u003c/span\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp dir=\"ltr\" style=\"font-size: large; line-height: 1.8; margin-bottom: 12pt; margin-top: 12pt; text-align: justify;\"\u003e\u003cspan style=\"font-variant: normal; vertical-align: baseline;\"\u003e\u003cbr /\u003e\u003c/span\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp dir=\"ltr\" style=\"line-height: 1.8; margin-bottom: 12pt; margin-top: 12pt; text-align: justify;\"\u003e\u003cspan style=\"font-variant: normal; vertical-align: baseline;\"\u003e\u003c/span\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\u003cdiv class=\"separator\" style=\"clear: both; font-size: large; text-align: center;\"\u003e\u003ca href=\"https://blogger.googleusercontent.com/img/a/AVvXsEirpVaRExJq1julsc5wnSzup_YLdhiSGjqE-Lc4PwjbyOOL-mIVC1LbfIT4iV0gcFpLtcVbHxGX3ZVifvscEjfCSPVlnUQwhQckYky-OlNWVJuYNdEXK72Lq2wjjf1URxKphVyr3_nt2GGqah056EJMZXMH3rf0mQkGgOCsYtdhkQtZwIZIW2xVyxEzz0da\" style=\"margin-left: 1em; margin-right: 1em;\"\u003e\u003cimg alt=\"KL The Guide, KLTG, Kuala Lumpur, Malaysia, Visit Kuala Lumpur, Explore Kuala Lumpur, Things to do in Kuala Lumpur, Kuala Lumpur travel guide, Malaysia travel guide, Kuala Lumpur attractions, Kuala Lumpur tourism, Travel Malaysia, Discover Kuala Lumpur, Kuala Lumpur city guide, Kuala Lumpur experiences\" data-original-height=\"969\" data-original-width=\"824\" height=\"640\" src=\"https://blogger.googleusercontent.com/img/a/AVvXsEirpVaRExJq1julsc5wnSzup_YLdhiSGjqE-Lc4PwjbyOOL-mIVC1LbfIT4iV0gcFpLtcVbHxGX3ZVifvscEjfCSPVlnUQwhQckYky-OlNWVJuYNdEXK72Lq2wjjf1URxKphVyr3_nt2GGqah056EJMZXMH3rf0mQkGgOCsYtdhkQtZwIZIW2xVyxEzz0da=w544-h640\" title=\"KL The Guide\" width=\"544\" /\u003e\u003c/a\u003e\u003c/div\u003e\u003cdiv class=\"separator\" style=\"clear: both; text-align: center;\"\u003e\u003cspan style=\"font-size: xx-small;\"\u003ePhoto credit: \u003ca href=\"https://kltheguide.com.my/\"\u003eKL The Guide\u003c/a\u003e\u003c/span\u003e\u003c/div\u003e\u003cdiv class=\"separator\" style=\"clear: both; text-align: center;\"\u003e\u003cbr /\u003e\u003c/div\u003e\u003c/span\u003e\u003cp\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\u003cdiv\u003e\u003cspan style=\"font-variant: normal; vertical-align: baseline;\"\u003e\u003cspan id=\"docs-internal-guid-1015250f-7fff-0104-6ac5-e265eb9fda50\"\u003e\u003ch3 dir=\"ltr\" style=\"font-size: large; line-height: 1.8; margin-bottom: 4pt; margin-top: 14pt; text-align: justify;\"\u003e\u003cspan style=\"font-variant: normal; vertical-align: baseline;\"\u003eSt. John’s Cathedral\u003c/span\u003e\u003c/h3\u003e\u003cp dir=\"ltr\" style=\"font-size: large; line-height: 1.8; margin-bottom: 12pt; margin-top: 12pt; text-align: justify;\"\u003e\u003cspan style=\"font-variant: normal; vertical-align: baseline;\"\u003eJust a stone’s throw away, the whitewashed walls of the \u003c/span\u003e\u003cspan style=\"font-variant: normal; font-weight: 700; vertical-align: baseline;\"\u003eCathedral of St. John the Evangelist\u003c/span\u003e\u003cspan style=\"font-variant: normal; vertical-align: baseline;\"\u003e offer a stark, peaceful contrast to the fiery bricks of the school.&nbsp;\u003c/span\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp dir=\"ltr\" style=\"font-size: large; line-height: 1.8; margin-bottom: 12pt; margin-top: 12pt; text-align: justify;\"\u003e\u003cspan style=\"font-variant: normal; vertical-align: baseline;\"\u003eInside, the city's traffic noise dies away, replaced by the cool, hollow stillness of high ceilings.&nbsp;\u003c/span\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp dir=\"ltr\" style=\"font-size: large; line-height: 1.8; margin-bottom: 12pt; margin-top: 12pt; text-align: justify;\"\u003e\u003cspan style=\"font-variant: normal; vertical-align: baseline;\"\u003eThe Parisian stained glass casts fractured patterns of ruby and sapphire across the pews, looking like a vibrant, silent storytelling that has watched over the hill since the late 1800s.\u003c/span\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp dir=\"ltr\" style=\"font-size: large; line-height: 1.8; margin-bottom: 12pt; margin-top: 12pt; text-align: justify;\"\u003e\u003cspan style=\"font-variant: normal; vertical-align: baseline;\"\u003e\u003cbr /\u003e\u003c/span\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp dir=\"ltr\" style=\"line-height: 1.8; margin-bottom: 12pt; margin-top: 12pt; text-align: justify;\"\u003e\u003cspan style=\"font-variant: normal; vertical-align: baseline;\"\u003e\u003c/span\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\u003cdiv class=\"separator\" style=\"clear: both; font-size: large; text-align: center;\"\u003e\u003ca href=\"https://blogger.googleusercontent.com/img/a/AVvXsEjkkDDdio4ZdSQJ4qlun-j2WSWILdUu0Awxskrd-njNA9TaRsouhKZv5MJFL0hH3ngV7KIEoyl4-Ar9ThAfGz9lQkG8yB56wH_8s_yMdHjYvqgYrgrNIudQdtTQSD9pKGSNDJADp52rXVqENoW9Kw8qi-xsRU0lurP9zPikSv0z46vYdjAFdaKwd38xvVSp\" style=\"margin-left: 1em; margin-right: 1em;\"\u003e\u003cimg alt=\"KL The Guide, KLTG, Kuala Lumpur, Malaysia, Visit Kuala Lumpur, Explore Kuala Lumpur, Things to do in Kuala Lumpur, Kuala Lumpur travel guide, Malaysia travel guide, Kuala Lumpur attractions, Kuala Lumpur tourism, Travel Malaysia, Discover Kuala Lumpur, Kuala Lumpur city guide, Kuala Lumpur experiences\" data-original-height=\"834\" data-original-width=\"801\" height=\"640\" src=\"https://blogger.googleusercontent.com/img/a/AVvXsEjkkDDdio4ZdSQJ4qlun-j2WSWILdUu0Awxskrd-njNA9TaRsouhKZv5MJFL0hH3ngV7KIEoyl4-Ar9ThAfGz9lQkG8yB56wH_8s_yMdHjYvqgYrgrNIudQdtTQSD9pKGSNDJADp52rXVqENoW9Kw8qi-xsRU0lurP9zPikSv0z46vYdjAFdaKwd38xvVSp=w616-h640\" title=\"KL The Guide\" width=\"616\" /\u003e\u003c/a\u003e\u003c/div\u003e\u003cdiv class=\"separator\" style=\"clear: both; text-align: center;\"\u003e\u003cspan style=\"font-size: xx-small;\"\u003ePhoto credit: \u003ca href=\"https://kltheguide.com.my/\"\u003eKL The Guide\u003c/a\u003e\u003c/span\u003e\u003c/div\u003e\u003cdiv class=\"separator\" style=\"clear: both; text-align: center;\"\u003e\u003cbr /\u003e\u003c/div\u003e\u003c/span\u003e\u003cp\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\u003cdiv style=\"font-size: large;\"\u003e\u003cspan style=\"font-variant: normal; vertical-align: baseline;\"\u003e\u003cspan id=\"docs-internal-guid-329e0cc3-7fff-4398-aa3e-d77750ed886d\"\u003e\u003cp dir=\"ltr\" style=\"line-height: 1.8; margin-bottom: 12pt; margin-top: 12pt; text-align: justify;\"\u003e\u003cspan style=\"font-variant: normal; vertical-align: baseline;\"\u003eFurther along the slope, the legacy branches out. \u003c/span\u003e\u003cspan style=\"font-variant: normal; font-weight: 700; vertical-align: baseline;\"\u003eSt. John’s International School\u003c/span\u003e\u003cspan style=\"font-variant: normal; vertical-align: baseline;\"\u003e carries the same name but speaks a different language of education.&nbsp;\u003c/span\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp dir=\"ltr\" style=\"line-height: 1.8; margin-bottom: 12pt; margin-top: 12pt; text-align: justify;\"\u003e\u003cspan style=\"font-variant: normal; vertical-align: baseline;\"\u003eHere, the halls are shared equally by boys and girls from the very start, a co-educational hum that brings a youthful energy to the ancient hill\u003c/span\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp dir=\"ltr\" style=\"line-height: 1.8; margin-bottom: 12pt; margin-top: 12pt; text-align: justify;\"\u003e\u003cspan style=\"font-variant: normal; vertical-align: baseline;\"\u003eIt is the evolution of the Lasallian spirit, which means retaining the discipline of the past while looking toward a global horizon.\u003c/span\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\u003ch3 dir=\"ltr\" style=\"line-height: 1.8; margin-bottom: 4pt; margin-top: 14pt; text-align: justify;\"\u003e\u003cspan style=\"font-variant: normal; vertical-align: baseline;\"\u003eThe Walk Behind the Greenery\u003c/span\u003e\u003c/h3\u003e\u003cp dir=\"ltr\" style=\"line-height: 1.8; margin-bottom: 12pt; margin-top: 12pt; text-align: justify;\"\u003e\u003cspan style=\"font-variant: normal; vertical-align: baseline;\"\u003eTo walk this path is to experience a specific kind of KL time travel.&nbsp;\u003c/span\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp dir=\"ltr\" style=\"line-height: 1.8; margin-bottom: 12pt; margin-top: 12pt; text-align: justify;\"\u003e\u003cspan style=\"font-variant: normal; vertical-align: baseline;\"\u003eOn one side, the primitive jungle of the forest reserve threatens to reclaim the pavement, while on the other, the Catholic heritage stands firm.\u003c/span\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\u003cul style=\"margin-bottom: 0px; margin-top: 0px; padding-inline-start: 48px;\"\u003e\u003cli aria-level=\"1\" dir=\"ltr\" style=\"font-variant: normal; list-style-type: disc; vertical-align: baseline; white-space: pre;\"\u003e\u003cp dir=\"ltr\" role=\"presentation\" style=\"line-height: 1.8; margin-bottom: 0pt; margin-top: 12pt;\"\u003e\u003cspan style=\"font-variant: normal; font-weight: 700; vertical-align: baseline; white-space: pre-wrap;\"\u003eThe Texture:\u003c/span\u003e\u003cspan style=\"font-variant: normal; vertical-align: baseline; white-space: pre-wrap;\"\u003e Rough bricks, smooth marble, and the iron-wrought gates.\u003c/span\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\u003c/li\u003e\u003cli aria-level=\"1\" dir=\"ltr\" style=\"font-variant: normal; list-style-type: disc; vertical-align: baseline; white-space: pre;\"\u003e\u003cp dir=\"ltr\" role=\"presentation\" style=\"line-height: 1.8; margin-bottom: 0pt; margin-top: 0pt;\"\u003e\u003cspan style=\"font-variant: normal; font-weight: 700; vertical-align: baseline; white-space: pre-wrap;\"\u003eThe Sound:\u003c/span\u003e\u003cspan style=\"font-variant: normal; vertical-align: baseline; white-space: pre-wrap;\"\u003e The distant hum of the LRT mixed with the rustle of tropical leaves.\u003c/span\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\u003c/li\u003e\u003cli aria-level=\"1\" dir=\"ltr\" style=\"font-variant: normal; list-style-type: disc; vertical-align: baseline; white-space: pre;\"\u003e\u003cp dir=\"ltr\" role=\"presentation\" style=\"line-height: 1.8; margin-bottom: 12pt; margin-top: 0pt;\"\u003e\u003cspan style=\"font-variant: normal; font-weight: 700; vertical-align: baseline; white-space: pre-wrap;\"\u003eThe Sight:\u003c/span\u003e\u003cspan style=\"font-variant: normal; vertical-align: baseline; white-space: pre-wrap;\"\u003e The KL Tower peeks over the gothic spires, a reminder of how fast the world moves outside this sanctuary.\u003c/span\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\u003c/li\u003e\u003c/ul\u003e\u003cp dir=\"ltr\" style=\"line-height: 1.8; margin-bottom: 12pt; margin-top: 12pt; text-align: justify;\"\u003e\u003cspan style=\"font-variant: normal; vertical-align: baseline;\"\u003eThe red bricks of Bukit Nanas do not just hold up roofs but also hold a narrative.&nbsp;\u003c/span\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp dir=\"ltr\" style=\"line-height: 1.8; margin-bottom: 12pt; margin-top: 12pt; text-align: justify;\"\u003e\u003cspan style=\"font-variant: normal; vertical-align: baseline;\"\u003eIt is a story of faith, a story of scholars, and a story of a city that, despite its rush to the future, still keeps its heart tucked away on a quiet, emerald hill.\u003c/span\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp dir=\"ltr\" style=\"line-height: 1.8; margin-bottom: 12pt; margin-top: 12pt; text-align: justify;\"\u003e\u003cspan style=\"font-variant: normal; vertical-align: baseline;\"\u003e\u003cbr /\u003e\u003c/span\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\u003cdiv class=\"separator\" style=\"clear: both; text-align: center;\"\u003e\u003cspan style=\"font-variant: normal; vertical-align: baseline;\"\u003e\u003ca href=\"https://blogger.googleusercontent.com/img/a/AVvXsEjKpMnkQdlsxdZcpL2KFm9gI4DSdAxtmIp2YuOE7MxTL-JYUE-YEoj5virz9qAR-dRrqcooJQ2mXAhhkG3nGSg28FkUIdaRPWi4XewafpD8s-J4aEomZx3aRKIpyt1VrA_tRFDmSYcFkIKt-xuOJZ5dcDxRGPoLR70zC-JpmZaeYjlm41Wbkk9Pf8vg0elH\" style=\"margin-left: 1em; margin-right: 1em;\"\u003e\u003cimg data-original-height=\"356\" data-original-width=\"640\" height=\"356\" src=\"https://blogger.googleusercontent.com/img/a/AVvXsEjKpMnkQdlsxdZcpL2KFm9gI4DSdAxtmIp2YuOE7MxTL-JYUE-YEoj5virz9qAR-dRrqcooJQ2mXAhhkG3nGSg28FkUIdaRPWi4XewafpD8s-J4aEomZx3aRKIpyt1VrA_tRFDmSYcFkIKt-xuOJZ5dcDxRGPoLR70zC-JpmZaeYjlm41Wbkk9Pf8vg0elH=w640-h356\" width=\"640\" /\u003e\u003c/a\u003e\u003c/span\u003e\u003c/div\u003e\u003cdiv class=\"separator\" style=\"clear: both; text-align: center;\"\u003e\u003cspan style=\"font-variant: normal; vertical-align: baseline;\"\u003e\u003cbr /\u003e\u003c/span\u003e\u003c/div\u003e\u003cdiv class=\"separator\" styl